              agents, builders, and homeowners who want stronger presentation and
              sharper market impact.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a href="#book" class="primary-btn">Book a Shoot</a>
              <a href="#portfolio" class="secondary-btn">View Portfolio</a>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-proof">
              <div>
                <strong>Fast turnaround</strong>
                <span>Ready for listing timelines and launch deadlines</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong>MLS-ready delivery</strong>
                <span>Optimized for websites, listings, and social campaigns</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong>Full media coverage</strong>
                <span>Photo, drone, video, and 3D tours in one workflow</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-collage glass-card">
            {heroCollageItems.length > 0 ? (
              <>
                <div class="collage-grid">
                  {heroCollageItems.map((item, index) => (
                    <div class={`collage-item collage-item-${index + 1}`}>
                      <Image
                        src={item.image}
                        alt={`Featured property collage image ${index + 1}`}
                        class="collage-image"
                        loading={index === 0 ? 'eager' : 'lazy'}
                        fetchpriority={index === 0 ? 'high' : 'auto'}
                      />
                    </div>
                  ))}
                </div>

                <div class="hero-overlay-card">
                  <p>Curated visuals that make premium listings feel premium before the first showing.</p>
                </div>
              </>
            ) : (
              <div class="hero-collage-fallback">
                <p>Add these files in <strong>src/assets</strong>:</p>
                <p>JAR05747.avif, JAR05750.avif, JAR05753.avif, JAR05756.avif, JAR05759.avif</p>
              </div>
            )}
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="trust-strip">
        <div class="section-shell trust-grid glass-card">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Professional Finish</p>
            <p class="section-copy">
              Balanced lighting, polished edits, and presentation designed to
              raise perceived value.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Market Focused</p>
            <p class="section-copy">
              Built for agents, brokerages, developers, and sellers who need
              listing-ready media.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Consistent Quality</p>
            <p class="section-copy">
              Reliable visual standards across interiors, exteriors, aerials,
              and walkthrough coverage.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="services" class="section-pad">
        <div class="section-shell">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
              <h2 class="section-title">Media packages built for serious listings.</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="section-copy section-heading-copy">
              From polished photography to drone media and 3D tours, every
